#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Writes this case's fixture data into the run's workspace (both arms see the same files).
# Generated by benchmarks/builder; edit the case script there, not this file.
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p resources
cat > resources/notes.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Notes
- Thistle & Pine Outfitters sells outdoor clothing online.
- Our Autumn catalogue was mailed to 60,000 past customers on 7 September (it has QR codes to the site).
- Exports: GA4 weekly totals with store orders, GA4 traffic by source/medium per month, landing pages, September blog page views, and the GA4/site change history.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
cat > resources/september_report_draft.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Thistle & Pine: September web performance (draft for the CMO)

## Our best month ever
- **Sessions per week up +39% vs July.** The new content plan is working.
- **GA4 revenue per week up +36% vs July.**
- Engagement rate slipped from 63.3% to 53.2%; we will review content quality.
- **Direct traffic up +92% per week**: brand awareness is building.
- **Email revenue fell from $39,411 in July to $13,214 in September** in the channel report. We propose cutting email frequency to once a week and moving the saving to paid social.
- Top content in September: /blog/winter-layering-guide (18,590 views).

## Proposal
Raise Q4 targets by 25% on sessions and revenue, based on September's run rate.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
